{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Phase 6 gate window",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "expr": "loopruntime_dogfood_gate_window_active == 1",
        "iconColor": "rgba(255, 96, 96, 1)",
        "enable": true,
        "tagKeys": "phase"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "§6.A.4 Phase 6 Dogfood Gate — 4h soak monitoring. Operator opens the gate by creating ConfigMap loopruntime-dogfood-gate-window with annotation runtime.getloopscale.com/dogfood-window=active; starts k6 traffic; waits 4h watching this dashboard. Auto-fail criteria: rollback P95 > 705ms (audit baseline) OR API P95 > 500ms OR any SEV-1 firing OR traffic generator dies for > 10min.",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Gate window status",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "max(loopruntime_dogfood_gate_window_active)", "refId": "A" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "value": "0", "text": "CLOSED" },
            { "type": "value", "value": "1", "text": "OPEN (gate running)" }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "gray", "value": null },
              { "color": "blue", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Rollback P95 (4h window)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 6, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "max(loopruntime_phase6_rollback_p95_4h_ms)", "refId": "A" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 500 },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 600 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 705 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area" }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "API P95 latency (1h window)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(loopruntime_api_request_duration_seconds_bucket[1h])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 300 },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 400 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 500 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area" }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Traffic gen RPS (5m avg)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 18, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(loopruntime_phase6_reads_total[5m])) + sum(rate(loopruntime_phase6_writes_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 30 }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Rollback P95 (live) vs 705ms budget",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 4, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(loopruntime_rollback_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "rollback p95 (5m)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "705",
          "legendFormat": "705ms budget (audit baseline)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2 }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "API request latency (P50/P95/P99)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 4, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(loopruntime_api_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(loopruntime_api_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(loopruntime_api_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "expr": "500",
          "legendFormat": "p95 budget (500ms)",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2 }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Traffic generator: reads vs writes",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 12, "w": 12, "h": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(loopruntime_phase6_reads_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "reads/s",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(loopruntime_phase6_writes_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "writes/s",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(loopruntime_phase6_errors_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "errors/s",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "stacking": { "mode": "none" } }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Active alerts during gate window",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 12, "w": 12, "h": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (alertname, severity) (ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{ alertname }} ({{ severity }})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2 }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "values": ["last", "max"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Operator decision tree",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 18, "w": 24, "h": 10 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## §6.A.4 Phase 6 Dogfood Gate — operator decision tree\n\n**Gate criteria (ALL must be true at t=4h):**\n\n- Panel 1: gate window status OPEN sustained 4h\n- Panel 2: rollback P95 (4h) ≤ 705ms (audit baseline)\n- Panel 3: API P95 (1h) ≤ 500ms\n- Panel 4: traffic RPS ≥ 30 (k6 active throughout)\n- Panel 8: ZERO non-Phase6 SEV-1 alerts firing during window\n- Chaos Mesh: at least one chaos experiment ran successfully during window (verify via `kubectl get podchaos,networkchaos,iochaos -A` count > 0)\n\n**ABORT triggers (any one):**\n\n- Panel 5 spikes > 705ms sustained 5m → Phase6RollbackLatencyExceeds705ms alert fires → ABORT\n- Panel 6 P95 spikes > 500ms sustained 10m → Phase6APILatencyExceeds500ms → ABORT\n- Panel 7 errors/s spikes (>1/s sustained) → traffic gen seeing 5xx; investigate before continuing\n- Panel 8 shows any non-Phase6 SEV-1 firing → Phase6SEV1Detected → ABORT\n- Panel 4 drops below 5/s for 10m → traffic gen died; restart k6 OR ABORT (SLOs become meaningless)\n\n**On ABORT:**\n\n1. Close the gate window: `kubectl annotate cm loopruntime-dogfood-gate-window -n loopruntime-system runtime.getloopscale.com/dogfood-window-` (removes annotation)\n2. Stop k6: kill the running process (Ctrl-C if foreground; `pkill k6` otherwise)\n3. File abort artifact: see dogfood-slo-gate-runbook.md § Phase 5 (abort variant) for the audit template\n4. Diagnose: which panel pointed at the failure? Spec the remediation; restart the gate from Phase 0 after fix lands\n\n**On SUCCESS (t=4h, all panels GREEN):**\n\n1. Close the gate window (same kubectl annotate command)\n2. Stop k6\n3. File the SUCCESS audit artifact (template in runbook § Phase 5)\n4. Path-to-maturity 4.0 advances: §6.A.4 gate is the last engineering-side criterion before the customer day-trial gate (§6.A.2 — out of scope for §6.A.4)"
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "tags": ["loopruntime", "phase6", "dogfood-gate", "audit-M03", "audit-M09", "slo"],
  "time": { "from": "now-4h", "to": "now" },
  "title": "Phase 6 Dogfood Gate",
  "uid": "loopruntime-dogfood-slo-gate",
  "version": 1
}
